# Test: status-bar word count catches up after typing.
# stats() is O(lines), so the status bar recomputes at most once
# per 250ms of wall time while typing, or as soon as the buffer
# has been still for 5 frames (settle). Either way the bar must
# be fresh shortly after typing stops; wait_frames 3000 covers
# both the settle and the 250ms window with room to spare.

type "hello world"
wait_frames 3000
expect_text "Words: 2"
